    "name": "Okra Accounts API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Specification of the Okra open-finance API. Okra connected applications to Nigerian bank accounts to retrieve authentication details, balances, transactions, identity, and income, and to initiate bank-to-bank payments. All product and query endpoints are POST requests authenticated with a Bearer secret key. NOTE: Okra wound down operations in May 2025; endpoints are documented as they were publicly published and may no longer be live.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Okra Support\n Email: support@okra.ng",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
